{"step_index":1642,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-08T01:15:14Z","thinking":"**Correlating Email and Address Data**\n\nThe email `333image@naver.com` is linked to the representative \"이미지,\" which strongly suggests a visual element. The provided address is located in Songpa-gu, but the zip code `05021` appears to be for Hwayang-dong, Gwangjin-gu. This is an inconsistency that needs to be clarified. I need to verify if the address in Songpa-gu is correct, considering the zip code discrepancy.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"node -e \\\"\\nconst dns = require('dns');\\nconst net = require('net');\\n\\nconst email = '333image@naver.com';\\nconst domain = email.split('@')[1];\\n\\ndns.resolveMx(domain, (err, addresses) => {\\n  if (err || !addresses.length) {\\n    console.log('DNS MX Error:', err);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  addresses.sort((a, b) => a.priority - b.priority);\\n  const mxHost = addresses[0].exchange;\\n\\n  const socket = net.createConnection(25, mxHost);\\n  socket.setEncoding('utf-8');\\n  socket.setTimeout(8000);\\n\\n  let step = 0;\\n  socket.on('data', (data) => {\\n    if (step === 0 && data.startsWith('220')) {\\n      step++;\\n      socket.write('HELO check.com\\\\r\\\\n');\\n    } else if (step === 1 && data.startsWith('250')) {\\n      step++;\\n      socket.write('MAIL FROM:<test@check.com>\\\\r\\\\n');\\n    } else if (step === 2 && data.startsWith('250')) {\\n      step++;\\n      socket.write('RCPT TO:<' + email + '>\\\\r\\\\n');\\n    } else if (step === 3) {\\n      console.log('RCPT RESULT:', data.trim());\\n      socket.write('QUIT\\\\r\\\\n');\\n      socket.end();\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  socket.on('error', (err) => console.log('Socket error:', err.message));\\n  socket.on('timeout', () => {\\n    console.log('Socket timeout');\\n    socket.destroy();\\n  });\\n});\\n\\\"\"","Cwd":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\resilient-bardeen\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"10000","toolAction":"\"Checking SMTP deliverability for 333image@naver.com\"","toolSummary":"\"Verify 333image@naver.com\""}}]}
