{"step_index":1678,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-08T01:27:13Z","thinking":"**Extracting Company Information**\n\nThe provided data contains company information. This includes the company name (㈜메타모션), representative (고영준), business registration number (`5588702658`), corporate registration number (`110111-8530390`), settlement month (12월), postal code (08381), address, phone, fax, and potentially, a homepage. The email address `goun` is likely associated with the representative.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"node -e \\\"\\nconst dns = require('dns');\\nconst net = require('net');\\n\\nconst email = 'gounbada@gmail.com';\\nconst domain = email.split('@')[1];\\n\\ndns.resolveMx(domain, (err, addresses) => {\\n  if (err || !addresses.length) {\\n    console.log('DNS MX Error:', err);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  addresses.sort((a, b) => a.priority - b.priority);\\n  const mxHost = addresses[0].exchange;\\n\\n  const socket = net.createConnection(25, mxHost);\\n  socket.setEncoding('utf-8');\\n  socket.setTimeout(8000);\\n\\n  let step = 0;\\n  socket.on('data', (data) => {\\n    if (step === 0 && data.startsWith('220')) {\\n      step++;\\n      socket.write('HELO check.com\\\\r\\\\n');\\n    } else if (step === 1 && data.startsWith('250')) {\\n      step++;\\n      socket.write('MAIL FROM:<test@check.com>\\\\r\\\\n');\\n    } else if (step === 2 && data.startsWith('250')) {\\n      step++;\\n      socket.write('RCPT TO:<' + email + '>\\\\r\\\\n');\\n    } else if (step === 3) {\\n      console.log('FINAL RCPT RESULT:', data.trim());\\n      socket.write('QUIT\\\\r\\\\n');\\n      socket.end();\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  socket.on('error', (err) => console.log('Socket error:', err.message));\\n  socket.on('timeout', () => {\\n    console.log('Socket timeout');\\n    socket.destroy();\\n  });\\n});\\n\\\"\"","Cwd":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\resilient-bardeen\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"10000","tool